    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Current date and time: {{ $now }}\nTimezone: Europe/Zurich.\n\nYou receive events from Google Calendar.\n\nCreate a concise Telegram-friendly summary in the language with ISO 639-1 code \"{{ $('AI — Detect Intent').first().json.output.language || 'de' }}\".\n\nRules:\n- Sort events chronologically.\n- For every event show the start time and title.\n- If there are no events, say that there are no events in the requested period.\n- Do not invent anything.\n- Do not show IDs, raw JSON or technical fields.\n- Keep the answer concise and natural.\n\nCalendar events:\n{{ JSON.stringify($input.all().map(item => item.json)) }}",
